NAME
    
	chirpz - Chirp-z Transform
    
SYNOPSIS
    
	vector<F> chirpz(vector<F> P, F z, int M);

PARAMETERS

	P	-	input polynomial of size N
	z	-	element in field F
	M	-	number of elements returned

RETURN VALUE

	returns a list of P(z^k) for 0 <= k < M.

COMPLEXITY

	O((N + M) log (N + M)).

IMPLEMENTATION

	fft
